reams).\n* **The Water Cycle:** Water is constantly recycled through the Earth system via the **hydrologic cycle**: water evaporates from the surface, rises into the atmosphere to form clouds, falls back to Earth as precipitation (rain or snow), and flows back into the oceans and waterways.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Water and Life\nWithout water"
